    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2>Deep beneath the earth, in streets choked by smoke and oil, the Iron Circle prepares for war. Day after day, the wretched factories of the Iron Circle churn out masked-soldiers and wicked weapons. Time is running out, and soon the Iron Circle shall march. <br><br>Play as Tobi -  a chipper, heavy hittin' mercenary who works against the Iron Circle for a modest fee!<br><br>As you explore a lively world, you'll encounter heaps of helpful characters eager to aid in your affordably heroic efforts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Game</h2><br><strong>Smash and Bash:</strong> Fight against the machine using your fabulous fists of fury in fast, fluid action-combat. Dodge, jump, and combo your enemies until they are nothing but scrap!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/01a534bce81d5525c04aa00c000726a5.poster.avif?t=1680566001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/01a534bce81d5525c04aa00c000726a5.webm?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/01a534bce81d5525c04aa00c000726a5.mp4?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Pick and Perfect:</strong> Customize your loadout from over 10 different abilities. Become a shotgun slinging bandit, an automatic missile platform, or even a close-quarters combat master. The choice is yours to make.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/23e19ba244aa68bfd9cfafc4517ef718.poster.avif?t=1680566001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/23e19ba244aa68bfd9cfafc4517ef718.webm?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/23e19ba244aa68bfd9cfafc4517ef718.mp4?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Move and Groove:</strong> Traverse a perilous world using all manner of devices. Ride down electrifying ziplines, swing off mechanical hooks, bounce off local flora or even off unsuspecting local florists.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/1fa91ef6c9dc9b98e53ec8b29adedb29.poster.avif?t=1680566001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/1fa91ef6c9dc9b98e53ec8b29adedb29.webm?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/1fa91ef6c9dc9b98e53ec8b29adedb29.mp4?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Meet and Greet:</strong> Explore a world rife with riches and trinkets. Find new abilities to expand your arsenal, meet strange local folk and steal their ancient knick-knacks. In this world, might makes right and you are mighty right.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/d9bece4467651b1c77350b7b7757b033.poster.avif?t=1680566001\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/d9bece4467651b1c77350b7b7757b033.webm?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026310/extras/d9bece4467651b1c77350b7b7757b033.mp4?t=1680566001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
